  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0150_eed0809ea83c.png\" style=\"width: 299px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>14</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|